✅ Story 1: IOP Product Activation and Visibility

Before:
The IOP (IELTS on Paper) product was not integrated into CMDS or visible in the UI, which made it impossible for stakeholders to configure, track, or manage it like other IELTS products.

What We Did:

    Activated IOP product in lower and production environments.

    Published the product to the ORS system so it could be consumed downstream.

    Updated the LPR.PRODUCT table to ensure the correct format (PB) was set.

    Made IOP visible in the CMDS UI's product management screen.

Impact:
The IOP product is now fully functional and discoverable within CMDS, allowing operational teams to manage it just like other existing products.

