✅ Story 5: Foundational Enhancements and System Integration Support

Before:
There were integration dependencies on external systems like Cambs, and foundational work was needed to support upcoming CUPA DS features.

What We Did:

    Provided Test Centre dispatch address details to Cambs System to enable communication between systems.

    Initiated foundational development for CUPA DS integration to support future functionality.

Impact:
These foundational stories ensure smoother future system interactions and data flow, reducing future rework and setting up for scalability.

